# CURSOR RULES: ROADASAFE WEB ADMIN DASHBOARD

## Context
You are building the Admin Web Dashboard for "ROADASAFE" - a real-time pothole detection system using YOLOv8.

## Tech Stack
- React.js + TypeScript (Vite)
- Styling: Tailwind CSS
- Routing: react-router-dom
- Maps: leaflet & react-leaflet
- Icons: lucide-react

## Business Logic & Thresholds
- Urgency Formula: Score = (0.35 * L) + (0.25 * K) + (0.20 * P) + (0.20 * T)
- Categories:
  - Low: 0 - 33 (Green marker)
  - Medium: 34 - 66 (Yellow marker)
  - High: 67 - 100 (Red marker)
- Statuses: Pending, Terverifikasi, Dalam Penanganan, Selesai, Ditolak

## Guidelines
- Write modular, clean TypeScript components.
- Use mock data until REST endpoints are connected.
- Keep UI modern and enterprise-grade using Tailwind CSS.